+## [v0.1.15-test.1] - 2026-11-25
+
+> R28 — UI review candidate; full Android compilation and device verification pending.
+
+### English
+- Harden dock geometry, animation interruption, window lifecycle, snackbar replacement and landscape overflow handling.
+- Improve accessible tab labels, equal tab sizes and tint state restoration; keep retry actions usable.
+- Include an independent CI build gate and an original-signer verification script. No protocol or media changes.
+
+### 简体中文
+- 加固导航重排、动画中断、弹窗生命周期、提示消息替换与横屏溢出处理。
+- 改善标签无障碍语义、等高布局和着色恢复；保留弹窗重试能力。
+- 新增独立 CI 构建验证及原签名脚本；未修改连接协议及媒体模块，待 Android 编译与真机验证。
+
+## [v0.1.14-test.1] - 2026-11-25
+
+> R27 — iOS 27-inspired Android UI refresh; not an Apple implementation. Source-only, pending Android build/device verification.
+
+### English
+- Introduce a floating glass-style dock with animated selection and adjustable tint; preserve navigation destinations.
+- Refresh shared palettes, rounded surfaces, typography, switches, dialog transitions, and press/expand feedback.
+- Keep R26 connection, media and protocol code unchanged.
+
+### 简体中文
+- 新增悬浮玻璃风格导航、选中胶囊滑动动画及着色调节，原有三个页面入口保留。
+- 更新浅深色令牌、圆角、字体层级、开关、弹窗及按压/展开动效。
+- 保持 R26 连接、媒体和协议源码不变；本次仅源码静态验证，待编译及真机验证。
 
